{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"agent_message","text":"All four remaining bugs reproduce at `0cbd540` on Dart 3.13.3. The bonus is confirmed too: `foo:`, `a::b`, and `x:/y` are silently accepted, while both JVM readers throw. The issue check covered all 232 open and closed issues; I found no duplicates. Issue #174 concerns reader performance.\n"}}
